// Copy this file to `Secrets.xcconfig` (which is gitignored) and fill in your real values.
//
// Wiring (one-time, in Xcode):
//   1. Project → FlowState target → Info → Configurations.
//      Set both Debug and Release "Based on configuration file" to `Secrets.xcconfig`.
//   2. Info.plist already has matching `$(...)` passthroughs for these keys.
//   3. Build. Each key is read at runtime from Bundle.main.infoDictionary[<key>].
//
// Security note: even with this setup, keys are embedded in the app binary at build time.
// For public App Store builds, replace OpenAIClient's `endpoint` with a backend proxy URL
// so the OpenAI key never ships to users. RevenueCat's public Apple SDK key (appl_…) is
// designed to be embedded; the test_… key here is for sandbox only.

OPENAI_API_KEY = REPLACE_ME
REVENUECAT_API_KEY = REPLACE_ME
